00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.950
S-So cute.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.750
Are you interested in that teddy bear?

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.080
Y-Yes.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:15.340
