00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:59.320
After seventy years, I finally get a new master,

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.480
and she's just a flat-chested little girl.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.780
No eye candy at all.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:07.820
